@startuml createTeacher-analysis
skinparam linetype polyline

rectangle #CDEBA5 ":Teachers Open" as TeachersOpen
rectangle #CDEBA5 ":Collaboration EditTeacher" as EditTeacher

package createTeacher as "createTeacher()" {
    rectangle #629EF9 CreateTeacherView
    rectangle #b5bd68 TeacherController
    rectangle #F2AC4E TeacherRepository
    rectangle #F2AC4E Teacher
}

TeachersOpen -r-> CreateTeacherView: createTeacher()

CreateTeacherView -d-> TeacherController: validateMinimalData(codigo, nombres, apellidos) : boolean

TeacherController --> TeacherRepository: checkUniqueness(codigo) : boolean

CreateTeacherView --> TeacherController: createTeacher(codigo, nombres, apellidos) : Teacher

TeacherController --> TeacherRepository: create(codigo, nombres, apellidos) : Teacher

TeacherRepository -- Profesor

CreateTeacherView ..> EditTeacher: <<include>> editarProfesor(profesorNuevo)

@enduml